    "rarities": ["SSR"],
    "reference_sections": [
      {
        "title": "Passives",
        "paragraphs": ["Seal Ring (unlocked in the Seal Ritual): In the inventory, place a material into this gear’s slot to convert it in battle into a stat buff for the party (various rarity of materials give differing stat buffs to the party). The material’s stat begins at <b class=\"codex-value\">100%</b> its value.", "The rune will float above the equipping character’s head and provide an unremovable buff <b class=\"holy-aura\">[Holy Aura]</b>. By sensing magic signatures, the rune’s power discerns weaknesses: nearby opponents will have an element resistance reduction of <b class=\"codex-value\">-15%</b> matching the equipping character’s affinity. In trade, 5 MP will drain every <b class=\"codex-value\">2</b> seconds to maintain effect.",
        "<u>Magnitude</u>: The amount of <b class=\"shield\">[Shield]</b> gain contributes to extending the duration of buffs on the party, +1 second whenever gaining an amount equal to or above 5% of the equipping character’s max health (Cooldown: 5 seconds).", "{{effect:holy-aura}}"]
      }
    ],
    "source": {"title": "Mystical Legends Game Design", "url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-95tvkDwbZnsN_vPy7gM4aJgFCXnzDQ2go8kIhIyAaw/edit", "section": "Equipment and Support", "modified": "2026-10-19"},
